"did you pick up a word like “nijntje”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫에, ⟪k:8⟫에이……, ⟪k:9⟫놀래키지 마!⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Nijntje란 말"
"은 ⟪k:12⟫누구한테 주워들었어?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_DD7ECC90_0FCE_42C3_8D3F_B489ED9F6D46
