"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Haha... ⟪k:2⟫I’m sorry.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You just looked so much like a rabbit there,⟪k:5⟫the "
"way you were tossing your head back and forth,⟪k:6⟫looking around for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫하하…… ⟪k:2⟫미안해.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫두리번거리는 게 ⟪k:5⟫영락없이 토끼 같길래."

