msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Did you have any trouble out at sea?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Did you fall ill, or get caught in a "
"storm,⟪k:4⟫or run into any kind of danger at all?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫항해 중에 ⟪k:2⟫별탈 없었어? ⟪k:3⟫어디 안 좋아지거나 ⟪k:4⟫태풍에 휘말리는 등……, ⟪k:5⟫위험"
"한 적 없었어?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C4424AD8_E703_4D36_BA4B_94173601FBD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c74caa22c1cc720391abaad29c16e8f92676436b7ca4fd7667c93bdea2a79972
