msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C4424AD8_E703_4D36_BA4B_94173601FBD4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, there was no trouble.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Everything went fine, without incident.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The "
"sea god was watching over us, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫괜찮아, ⟪k:2⟫아무 탈도 없었어. ⟪k:3⟫별탈 없이―― 무사히 끝났어. ⟪k:4⟫해신의 가호를 받은 "
"걸까……."

